Since we have named Artifacts that have special uses, I think we need
named pets.  The two most potent of which would be Rin Tin Tin and
Lassie for dogs.  Both have the ability to open unlocked doors and
to warn you by barking when you approach traps.  They would also be
more effective in combat.

	Lassie barks at the wall --more
	You discover a secret door.
	Rin Tin Tin pulls you back --more
	You discover a land mine.

Either would also be able to lead you if you were blind, either on a
leash or by taking your hand.  They might also be able to follow you
independently down or up levels.

There are other names available, too: Greedy and Grim for wolves,
Cerberus and Garm for Hellhounds ... 

As for cats, mine are certainly good at bringing me dead things, and
for noting important goings on outside.  Important to cats that is.
I have seen them chase dogs on occassion and are devastating to snakes.
You should be able to pick up your cat and stuff him in a bag, though,
since what cats like to do best is sleep.

